# 统一换行符：仓库内一律 LF，检出时由 git 按平台处理
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做换行符转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# 避免 GitHub 把书稿当"语言"统计
book/*.md linguist-documentation
docs/*.md linguist-documentation
README.md linguist-documentation
CONTRIBUTING.md linguist-documentation
LICENSE linguist-documentation
